      "date": "2026-05-23T21:03:06.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹29.56 (up from ₹11.53 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹90.7b (up 6.5% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹6.99b (up 156% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.7% (up from 3.2% in FY 2025). Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) surpassed analyst estimates by 45%. Revenue is forecast to grow 10% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 3.8% decline forecast for the Basic Materials industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 19% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
