      "date": "2026-02-10T11:52:51.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations while revenues lag behind",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.31 (up from ₹7.62 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹21.1b (up 6.2% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹3.86b (up 111% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 18% (up from 9.2% in 3Q 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 5.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Basic Materials industry in India are expected to remain flat. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
